# Fetched source documents. Third-party copyrighted material (WHO, NHS, charity
# and journal PDFs) cached by scripts/fetch-source.mjs so extraction is
# reproducible locally. The packets cite every source by URL, so the evidence
# trail survives without redistributing the documents themselves.
packets/.sources/
